L¤¥cs-pickL„£cs-rollL”£,n>rh…hh…iµ"…j…oµB…kè¥oğµBHµ"HèÆo€ñ¥kH¥jH¥iH¥hH`9nr>h…hh…ih…j…oh…k¥oğÊh•"h•BÆo€ñ¥j¤kÊ•"”B¥iH¥hH`lsynonym©@ ï¶ î¸ É¶ˆ±b…j­:…b­;…c ¥o) b‘b¥o) ğ¥j í§¥hğ ␀±d í§ÈÄhĞö©` í§ {2 .(dice hd)}
