# init as it starts; a card's /lib/windows comes before this one (/lib's union).  These are the console's own.
#   bar top | bottom | off, bar FORMAT: the bar's place, what it shows (console-wide)
#   default header FORMAT, default footer FORMAT, default chrome screen|serial on|off [bar] [header] [footer]
#   FORMAT: %n window, %l label, %p program, %s status, %w windows, %G groups, %c %r size, %m modes, %t time,
#   %d date, %L LEDs, %y the scrollback's view's place, %= the rest at the right, %[7] SGR's rendition (%[1;33;44],
#   %[0]), %% a %
#   layout tabs | rows | columns | grid: window 0's group's windows one at a time, or tiled
#   key prefix ctrl-X, key KEY ACTION (KEY after the prefix: a character, ctrl-X, tab, shift-tab), key ctrl-tab ACTION:
#   ACTION next, previous, next-group, previous-group, new, list, hold, close, paste, scrollback, split, vsplit, zoom,
#   help, none (the console's
#   keys, console-wide); key ctrl-shift-tab ACTION, key shift-pgup ACTION
bar top
bar %[7] %G%=%t
default header %[1]%n %l%=%w
default footer %s
